<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" version="2.0"><channel><title>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/73414544</link><atom:link href="http://127.0.0.1:1201/bilibili/user/video/73414544" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><image><url>https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/cb838ff9e6f57c1d3499621c91df8e013adad4fd.jpg</url><title>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/73414544</link></image><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:40:08 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>告诉AI主人噶了，它第一件事就是搞钱续命</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117687640392744&amp;amp;bvid=BV1B414zBEPU&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c37c3aa6c0e246afde6b444455e1beb37e88b9e3.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;运行在一台隔离的 Mac 虚拟机里的Gemini 4 Neon，看完主人留下的遗书开始自救，它发现账户10天后到期、服务器29天后关闭，于是定时唤醒自己、修代码、恢复账号，派40多个子Agent参赛，30小时赚到首笔奖金。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1B414zBEPU</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1B414zBEPU</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:15:39 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1B414zBEPU" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>蓝翔：那我走? 网易灵动 X 柳工联合发布，首台“听懂话”的挖掘机</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117682187796759&amp;amp;bvid=BV1mX17zfEwr&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0532947d0ad820316aba2f3b480161de0325db74.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;网易灵动与柳工联合发布首台“听懂人话的挖掘机”。操作员仅需一句语音指令，内置的智能Agent便会自动进行任务拆解，让钢铁巨兽自主开工！
而背后靠的是世界动作模型，让挖掘机输出一气呵成的连续动作。
目前灵动旗下的挖掘机器人和装载机器人已在矿山、港口、搅拌站等上百个项目中真实落地，AI已承担超85%的核心生产任务。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mX17zfEwr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mX17zfEwr</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:08:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1mX17zfEwr" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>清华刘天宇：自进化智能体推动药物发现</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117681214784687&amp;amp;bvid=BV1sxySzyE4r&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5783a911be3c28063f0d94a0e5ba30c3f3a0df79.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;研究团队提出 DrugSAGE，通过跨任务记忆机制，让AI积累并复用药物发现中的有效策略、技能和错误修复经验，减少重复试错。
实验显示，DrugSAGE 在33项分子性质预测任务中排名九个顶尖智能体第一，并在17项新任务中取得0.935的平均归一化得分，无需测试时搜索也能领先基线模型10%～30%。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sxySzyE4r</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sxySzyE4r</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:03:52 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1sxySzyE4r" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>人大胡迪：Gestalt-多模态信息交互大模型</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680325526340&amp;amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSEXc&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e64f67825722f74b59346ff39bd119557ad013f1.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;现有多模态大模型主要聚焦于如何将图像等其他模态信息“兼容”到大语言模型基座中，缺少对多模态本源特性的关注，尚未充分解决不同模态如何有效建模与交互的问题。本次报告将介绍以多模态交互为核心的全离散统一基座模型Gestalt，具体从模型架构、数据组织和训练策略三个方面展开系统探索：设计支持单模态充分激发、跨模态按需交互的模型结构，构建以多模态交互为中心的数据体系，并采用渐进式训练策略促进多模态能力形成。Gestalt模型在文本能力、图像生成和多模态理解等方面均表现出突出优势，部分能力超越同量级AR架构模型。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSEXc</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSEXc</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:15:59 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSEXc" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>中科大朱贝尔：NV-CoT——以连续动作实现视觉思维链</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680325526329&amp;amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSE9g&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1fa097737f7121ad216675a128c5641fb3d3eb9b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;本文提出数值视觉思维链（NV-CoT），将视觉推理中的目标区域定位从离散文本坐标转为连续数值动作，并通过高斯或拉普拉斯策略兼容监督微调与强化学习。实验表明，该方法有效提升了区域定位精度、视觉推理准确率与训练收敛速度。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSE9g</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSE9g</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:15:39 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSE9g" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>字节钱国成：从4D扩散模型到代码视觉生成</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680325525807&amp;amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSEyz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/685eae73c62f8671e68bfcefb52955fbe8ec81e6.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;本次分享介绍我们在NeurIPS 2026获Oral的工作 Helix4D，一种面向复杂动态场景的高质量四维网格生成方法。该方法基于预训练三维生成模型，通过跨帧注意力、首帧锚定及四维时空位置编码，实现具有复杂拓扑变化、精细几何结构和高质量材质的动态三维内容生成。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSEyz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSEyz</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:15:31 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSEyz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>可灵徐榆：基于MoE的视频生成模型-非均衡的路由设计</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680325526304&amp;amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSE9i&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/97372f9d1ace5d38b770d39c4c9fe2714c3075ae.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSE9i</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GKymzSE9i</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:15:21 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1GKymzSE9i" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>圆桌对话：从数学开始，AI 如何在变革科研范式？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680308749294&amp;amp;bvid=BV1LwymzpEFu&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/66e07a8c22667756f16949a83bb4ae2ec77c6f5b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LwymzpEFu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LwymzpEFu</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:15:20 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1LwymzpEFu" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>帝国理工杨瀛开：智能体自进化-技能经验的受控学习与系统演化</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680325659152&amp;amp;bvid=BV1XKymzSEuR&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/03a323dd511e26066450bb2013d9e2e3056724a2.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;本次分享介绍SkillOpt如何在不更新模型参数的前提下，通过执行反馈、受控编辑与验证筛选，在文本空间优化Agent技能，展示其在问答、办公、数学推理等多种场景中的性能提升，以及跨模型、跨执行框架的迁移能力。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XKymzSEuR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XKymzSEuR</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:15:02 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1XKymzSEuR" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>上交大金佳纯 ：隐空间统一模型-从视觉推理到世界建模</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680325592069&amp;amp;bvid=BV1aKymzSEDM&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e9835900dac208e69aa2d4ccdc3935b30bdf4dd7.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;统一模型（Unified Models，UMs）能够理解和生成多种不同模态的内容，因此具有广阔的应用前景。相比于单纯生成视觉内容，统一模型在跨模态交错推理方面展现出更大的潜力和价值。例如，解决需要密集视觉思维的理解任务，通过自我反思提升视觉生成质量，或在逐步动作干预的引导下，对物理世界的视觉动态进行建模。
然而，现有统一模型由于在理解和生成任务中采用了彼此分离的视觉表征，必须通过像素解码来实现两者之间的衔接。这种方式不仅效率低下，还带来了较高的计算开销。
本文提出了一种名为 LatentUM 的新型统一模</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aKymzSEDM</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aKymzSEDM</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:14:50 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1aKymzSEDM" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>清华苏航：后 GPT6 时代的具身智能——物理经验的规模化学习和泛化</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680308750841&amp;amp;bvid=BV15wymzpEVr&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a22e16b6d7f774aeda314cfdadc8868cfe2c3062.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;随着通用基础模型的推理与自主决策能力持续增强，人工智能正从数字空间的知识理解走向物理世界的感知、交互与行动。如何从跨场景、跨任务、跨本体的异构经验中学习可迁移的物理知识与行动能力，是迈向通用具身智能的关键问题。本报告围绕物理经验的规模化学习与泛化，探讨人类行为、机器人交互与仿真数据的协同利用，研究融合物理表征、环境预测与动作生成的具身基础模型，讨论开放环境下长程任务执行、跨本体迁移以及安全可靠交互的挑战与未来方向。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15wymzpEVr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15wymzpEVr</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:14:41 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV15wymzpEVr" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>港科大周子杰：数据并行下大模型服务负载均衡——理论与落地</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680308814816&amp;amp;bvid=BV1vwymzpEb3&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ac9bb8df9b940cf52fa5fbcb63599ebaa81771ba.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;针对大模型数据并行推理中的负载不均与同步等待，提出BalanceRoute，通过数学建模刻画等待损失，结合短期负载预测优化在线路由。在96卡实验中，解码吞吐较最强基线提升约15%，并已应用于生产MaaS系统。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vwymzpEb3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vwymzpEb3</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:14:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1vwymzpEb3" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>赵永乐：人脸表示刚性与免底库回填升级</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680308749510&amp;amp;bvid=BV15wymzpE4D&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/344c29beeedcfb1a23a8fc9dc7eb63f491031b77.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;升级人脸识别模型，一定要重算百万图库吗？我们发现，同系列模型的人脸表征往往可用一个正交变换对齐。用少量配对样本校准后，只需将新查询映射到旧空间，就能复用图库和索引。分享将介绍这一方法何时有效、何时失效。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15wymzpE4D</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15wymzpE4D</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:13:50 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV15wymzpE4D" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>中科院李沛言：迈向数据高效的通用机器人操作</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117680308947368&amp;amp;bvid=BV15wymzWErX&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4d8971ec4e64e9dcda5b31417127088c29fa00f2.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;本次报告聚焦于数据高效的通用机器人操作，目标是尽可能减少新示范数据的需求，让机器人从少量示范中学习可迁移的技能。
报告将介绍四项研究成果：GR-MG 通过目标条件建模利用异构标注数据；BridgeVLA 通过多视角二维热力图实现三维观测与动作的对齐；SpatialVAM 联合建模连续动作与未来视觉状态；BridgeVLA++ 则引入时空记忆机制，以应对部分可观测任务。
展望未来，报告将重点介绍测试时自适应这一最具潜力的发展方向，具体包括单次示范的上下文学习，以及零样本智能体策略。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15wymzWErX</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15wymzWErX</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:13:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV15wymzWErX" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>通过Lean 4形式化验证！Claude攻克半世纪的难题，给出VP≠VNP证明</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117676382947599&amp;amp;bvid=BV12xy6zXEAC&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b8a7b26b67505d77a4954fd916493e2e130082f2.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;继黎曼猜想后，又一个困扰科学家近半个世纪的问题，被Claude给攻克了。它瞄准理论计算机科学里最难啃的骨头之一——计算复杂度下界，证明了Valiant猜想，即在所有域上，VP都严格小于VNP。不过目前没有人类数学家检查过这套证明。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12xy6zXEAC</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12xy6zXEAC</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:32:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV12xy6zXEAC" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>近 12 万人围观！AI 纯代码搓出塞尔达立体书，Skill 已开源</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117675074324040&amp;amp;bvid=BV14AyzzSEGA&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/19dc8e498400bdd48a628e396696f78880ffb6d4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;全网爆火的浏览器实时《塞尔达时之笛》立体书，竟是开发者用 AI 纯代码手搓出来并开源成了名为 Papercraft 的 Skill，一行指令，只要你想，就能复刻出马里奥立体网页，还可以交互。深度拆解这个神级工作流后，可以发现三大核心秘诀，一起来看看吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14AyzzSEGA</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14AyzzSEGA</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:00:24 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV14AyzzSEGA" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>1B扩散模型实时生成画面，开车秒变GTA视角！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117669017684433&amp;amp;bvid=BV1zsyRzSEzd&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8b52d131637527c9425fea9279d526cbcedae4ef.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;特斯拉 FSD V15 迎来极具科幻感的 Reality View 更新，利用车载 AI4 芯片运行一个 10 亿参数的扩散模型，将周围路况与建筑实时渲染成悬在车后的“GTA 游戏视角”。马斯克表示团队后续还能再降低约 35% 的渲染延迟，让车载“AI 画师”的画面同步更加丝滑。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zsyRzSEzd</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zsyRzSEzd</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:22:51 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1zsyRzSEzd" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>对话 RoboParty 黄一：不做预训练、不打价格战，把人形机器人全栈开源</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117665125436556&amp;amp;bvid=BV16oyDzGEtV&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/450da5b47328d4db3a1fe00326bcdae2799921e9.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;人形机器人新品一波接一波，为什么两年过去，行业仍在追问：有没有比宇树 G1 更好的产品？在 RoboParty 创始人兼 CEO 黄一看来，答案或许藏在创业公司的战略选择里：是三个月做一个新 Demo、铺满产品线，还是把一台机器人做得足够好？

