本期机器之心×张江AI创新小镇联名播客，对话这位年轻的机器人创业者。从宿舍里手搓开源机器人，到带队打造全栈开源的 RP1，黄一谈开源生态、产品化细节、科研市场，以及通用大模型可能「吃掉」机器人大脑的冲击。正片将于11月23日上线，敬请期待</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13xyWzUExj</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13xyWzUExj</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:58:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV13xyWzUExj" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>马斯克谈黄仁勋难掩悲伤：英伟达失去他，就像公牛队踢走乔丹</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117647911947397&amp;amp;bvid=BV1oRyWzZEKp&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c1536bf879924cf0cb428dac627034b297d18bc3.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;马斯克替老友鸣不平，他把黄仁勋比作巅峰时期的乔丹，直言“球队连胜你却把乔丹踢了”，认为没人能取代他。被问到是否愿意聘用黄仁勋，马斯克回答：当然愿意。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oRyWzZEKp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oRyWzZEKp</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:53:44 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1oRyWzZEKp" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>英伟达隐藏福利！8G矿卡爆改80G显存，跑分反超A100</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117641687731149&amp;amp;bvid=BV1vYsb66EDb&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2205229d9a7b0476f0a33e59564f4543374f3f5c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;安全研究员 Kate 对矿潮时期的英伟达 CMP 170HX 矿卡进行了硬核硬件逆向，在启动瞬间通过精密的电压干扰打破出厂限制，成功释放了被锁死的隐藏硬件。实测 10 张矿卡中有 9 张直接解锁了完整的 80GB 显存与海量计算单元，部分算力测试甚至反超正版零售 A100 约 18%。一起看看怎么回事～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vYsb66EDb</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vYsb66EDb</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:31:56 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1vYsb66EDb" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>GPT-6.2 翻车了？跑分大涨，开发者却发长文说讨厌它</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117636637656989&amp;amp;bvid=BV15tsm6dEyS&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9b346487a1794d511b8b14e50b7038891d5736b8.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 发布了新模型GPT-6.2 Astra和GPT-6.2 Sol，能力更强，完成任务消耗的 token 更少，成本也更低。不过网友体验后却并不这么认为，一时间差评如潮。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15tsm6dEyS</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15tsm6dEyS</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:06:51 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV15tsm6dEyS" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>不是考古学家，游客用AI花72小时，发现未被登记的玛雅遗址</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117630967087837&amp;amp;bvid=BV1kzsz6jErE&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/15d13975bc1af786af943b979b3b6d4a726182a7.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;从度假时的一个随想，到收到墨西哥国家考古研究所的回复，只用了72小时。一个去秘鲁度假的人，让AI分析激光雷达数据找玛雅遗址，AI还真在1200平方公里地形中圈出山顶广场和金字塔，经墨西哥文物机构确认，这正是一处未登记的遗址。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kzsz6jErE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kzsz6jErE</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:06:05 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1kzsz6jErE" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>马斯克带头请愿！16万人求老黄回归，英伟达上演宫斗大戏</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117625363367672&amp;amp;bvid=BV141sP6sE1A&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3178d979d79a6f28d4f39fd6cc38b01b2895f0e4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;黄仁勋辞职短短几天，英伟达内部却同时上演“全球海选新 CEO”与“16 万人联名求老黄回归”的魔幻双线剧情。不仅临时 CEO 与老黄的过往投资分歧被媒体扒出、苏姿丰与库克等大佬被卷入接班名单。甚至有报道说连老黄自己都在琢磨怎么重返英伟达。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV141sP6sE1A</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV141sP6sE1A</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:22:46 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV141sP6sE1A" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>中国医疗AI公司力压GPT、Gemini，包揽全球AI测评榜单双第一 。</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117614542195295&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Y3s56bExg&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b31b00f019d03a6cb0d13b7d657170a1d4abde70.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;在MedBench及MMMU榜单中，德适iMed-6.0包揽全球前二，中国AI在医疗垂直领域交出硬核答卷，性能超越GPT与Gemini。从跑分霸榜到零代码赋能，国产原创底座的强势突围，将顶尖技术化为普惠生产力。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y3s56bExg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Y3s56bExg</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:26:48 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Y3s56bExg" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Claude记忆架构公开，原来AI也会做梦，醒来记性竟然更好了！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117608686814365&amp;amp;bvid=BV1YkWi6XEtF&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ced9deb3d1c4f386eea2aec89f603855eeaa3739.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI梦见的是电子羊吗？Anthropic最近公开了Claude记忆架构，他们发现AI记太多东西反而干不了正事，在闲时做梦能帮Claude打造有效记忆，大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YkWi6XEtF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YkWi6XEtF</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:38:37 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1YkWi6XEtF" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>搜索引擎上免费用！谷歌轻量模型Gemini 4 Hydrogen来了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117608116388639&amp;amp;bvid=BV17jWq68EVz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/27c436228e344554f3a836c7c2d3db1aefd45205.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gemini 4 Hydrogen来了，作为Gemini 3.8 Flash 的继任者，Hydrogen走“快准稳”路线，主打一个高效运行、快速响应，以及连续完成多步任务。在第三方榜单Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 上，评分超过了 Gemini 4 Argon。大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17jWq68EVz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17jWq68EVz</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:11:27 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV17jWq68EVz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>突发！黄仁勋正式辞职，英伟达接班人曝光，没想到竟然是....</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117604157097821&amp;amp;bvid=BV18UWo6gEg5&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/06dedd7acbabae5c741a1c5b66ca43a11b8be3e9.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一场婚外情风波不断发酵，又传出与直接向其汇报的副总裁存在纠葛，把掌舵英伟达 33 年的黄仁勋推到了职业生涯的关键十字路口。消息传出后董事会已就利益冲突和老黄的去留展开紧急讨论。长期集技术决策与大客户沟通于一身的核心灵魂人物一旦面临变动，英伟达的接班人难题与公司稳定运转正迎来前所未有的大考验。接班人究竟是谁，我们一起来看看吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18UWo6gEg5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18UWo6gEg5</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:25:34 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV18UWo6gEg5" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic达里奥IPO放话：十年内，癌症、阿尔茨海默等，都将成为历史</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117602747680029&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ejWd6GEuZ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8bcf7dc3d427db11ffaebc977c58cd17841cee63.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anthropic CEO达里奥认为，不到十年，癌症、阿尔茨海默病，心脏病、精神疾病这些问题就可能成为历史，AI将开启一个奇迹时代。大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ejWd6GEuZ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ejWd6GEuZ</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:26:09 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1ejWd6GEuZ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Claude 逆向32年老车！而且开始接管汽车</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117597379102537&amp;amp;bvid=BV1GNWm6UENs&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2f1451cee26a91a2df39b70aacb956c4ae893f23.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一位车主用一块 3 美元的小电路板，配合 Claude Code 让一辆 1994 年的老 Jeep 具备了语音询问车况、自动排查故障甚至控制油泵与重刷车载电脑的能力。与此同时，也有车主通过开源项目把手机导航完美移植到了宝马仪表盘上。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GNWm6UENs</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GNWm6UENs</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1GNWm6UENs" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>阿里 Qwen4-Max 预览版上线，编程与 Agentic 能力再升级</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117597127313667&amp;amp;bvid=BV1RGWy6LEDE&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f6fa44b4fca881d1328f3a8738f8cd5d5c194371.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Qwen4，要来了。11月11日，阿里 Qwen4-Max 预览版上线，编程与 Agentic 能力再升级。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RGWy6LEDE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RGWy6LEDE</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:36:18 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1RGWy6LEDE" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>订阅越久重置越多，Fable 5.2碾压Opus 5.5，30小时搞定费马大定理形式化</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117590986852981&amp;amp;bvid=BV1DJWg6kE8Y&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6e245cad3c226d555b229d950b956c6f58330074.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;此次视频由Fable 5.2制作。Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.2、Claude Mythos 5.2两款顶级模型，跑分全面超越Opus 5.5。实测8天从零写出操作系统原型，30小时完成费马大定理形式化证明……价格还降了，大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DJWg6kE8Y</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DJWg6kE8Y</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:36:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1DJWg6kE8Y" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>爱妻人设崩塌！黄仁勋承认婚外情，英伟达启动调查</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117585433594638&amp;amp;bvid=BV1axWx69EMx&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7a152554beea16cc216f68588dccff2b96f8f6fc.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;英伟达 CEO 黄仁勋公开为个人婚外情道歉，承认伤害了妻子与家人，同时董事会已针对涉及客户企业的绯闻对象启动独立调查。昔日“17 岁追妻、老婆买皮衣”的恩爱人设瞬间引发讨论，网友调侃离婚风险的同时也在关注股价波动。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1axWx69EMx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1axWx69EMx</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 08:02:39 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1axWx69EMx" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI 教父Hinton曾被 NeurIPS 拒稿！李飞飞访谈Jeff Dean，谷歌工程师之神预测也失误？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117568740264621&amp;amp;bvid=BV1a34B6YEd5&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/47c104f098610040d8bba61ce1264a7d1838c993.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;如今支撑所有大模型轻量化部署的“蒸馏圣经”——由 AI 教父 Geoffrey Hinton 与 Oriol Vinyals 等人联合撰写的开山论文，当年竟被顶级学术会议 NeurIPS 拒稿，理由居然是“不太可能产生任何影响”。这篇如今引用量破 4 万次的神作虽然险些被埋没，但它提出的“教师-学生模型”彻底改变了 AI 工业落地的格局。一起看看怎么回事～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a34B6YEd5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a34B6YEd5</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:20:04 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1a34B6YEd5" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>鼠鼠吃红利！AI 给小白鼠开颅注射，恢复良好</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117568153126746&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Nk4v61E4f&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4f1e7d412f7e59c407bee948616106ea9147128c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一项针对癫痫的基因治疗实验中，研究团队不仅让 AI 自主评估 19 种治疗方案并检索论文确定注射坐标，还让它直接控制摄像头与针头设备，为小白鼠完成了精密的脑部开颅注射。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nk4v61E4f</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nk4v61E4f</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 06:49:13 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Nk4v61E4f" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>ChatGPT Images 2.6来了，动态GIF、SVG导出，还能指哪改哪</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117563002521872&amp;amp;bvid=BV1UP486KEye&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7d137873839f62e971883a232bc076b21e663d32.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;ChatGPT Images 2.6太适合用来生成一套动态表情包了，可以使用提示词，或使用一张草图，制作动态GIF。这次升级，控制也更细了，可以在图片上标出具体要改的位置，设计好的图像还能导出SVG矢量图。图像生成速度也提升了50%，大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UP486KEye</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UP486KEye</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 08:59:47 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1UP486KEye" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI引发的数学界新焦虑，陶哲轩:数学家都不敢公开自己的研究了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117557432485664&amp;amp;bvid=BV1kuxQ6EEjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/529642b4847be734f45f0d21b1b5444936110afe.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;陶哲轩在最新的演讲中表示，因为担心研究想法被人抢先输入模型并发表，一些数学家开始隐藏自己的研究方向了。他更担心现实风险：当AI用于电网、空管和药物设计时，可能钻模型的漏洞，给出看似合格、却偏离真实目标的答案。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kuxQ6EEjo</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kuxQ6EEjo</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1kuxQ6EEjo" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>“走进船厂”视比特人形焊接机器人即将进船厂试运行</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117556811664277&amp;amp;bvid=BV1KrxQ64EHq&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f2c7a3e9b3c05143d54a19352316cd5f6729877a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;在船厂，机器人得先走到工件旁，才能开始焊接。地面坑洼、工件堆放杂乱，船舱内还有高低落差，轮式机器人通行受限。视比特机器人为此推出全尺寸双足人形焊接机器人。它身高170厘米，全身配备27个高扭矩、高精度关节，可迈步跨过障碍，适应船舱内高低错落的地形。
走到工件旁，还要找准焊缝。面对缺少固定工装的船舶建造现场，它结合激光雷达、ToF相机和3D激光线扫相机感知环境与工件，在3D视觉引导下自主焊接。任务规划、动作规划和运动控制由“大小脑”分层架构协同完成。这款机器人即将进入国内一家头部船厂试运行。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1KrxQ64EHq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1KrxQ64EHq</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1KrxQ64EHq" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>下一代 GPT 露面！奥特曼： AI 是新文艺复兴</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117556409008376&amp;amp;bvid=BV13xxS6fEdi&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a93e7daec147849e28e05f91eab24d9c6084a819.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 联合阿布扎比国家石油公司展现了 AI 在科研与能源领域的颠覆性突破，即将推出的下一代 GPT 模型驱动了一万个无层级、无老板的去中心化 AI 智能体，通过自主协作成功攻克了首个千禧年大奖难题。Sam Altman 强调，AI 正在从消耗能源转向反哺能源与基础科学，这场技术浪潮远不止是“新工业革命”，而是一场赋予每个人无限创造力与新知识爆发的“新文艺复兴”。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13xxS6fEdi</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13xxS6fEdi</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 05:06:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV13xxS6fEdi" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item></channel></rss>